  New workspace
  ┃ Directory
  ┃ project to open; an existing workspace for it is reused
  ┃ >

    Layout
      solo
      duo
      trio
      quad
      review
      auto

    Sandbox
      standard  sandboxed Bash, credentials denied
      strict    adds a network allowlist, no escape hatch
      off       no sandbox (a red shield)

   * a directory is required








